+// SanitizeTerminalText strips ANSI escape sequences and characters that cause
+// rendering issues in multi-line terminal output while preserving tabs and
+// newlines. Unlike SanitizeDisplayText, which flattens text into a single
+// table cell, this keeps line structure. It is the one filter for free-form
